  "question": {
    "text": "The value of $p$ and $q$ for which the function $f(x)=\\left\\{\\begin{array}{cl}\\frac{\\sin (p+1) x+\\sin x}{x} & x < 0 \\\\ q & , x=0 \\\\ \\frac{\\sqrt{x+x^2}-\\sqrt{x}}{x^{3 / 2}} & , x>0\\end{array}\\right.$ is continuous for all $\\mathrm{x}$ in $\\mathrm{R}$, is",
